@startuml
title MedNexus AI - State Diagram

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> QueryEntered : User enters query

QueryEntered --> Processing : Submit search

Processing --> RetrievingData : Valid query

Processing --> Error : Invalid query

RetrievingData --> GeneratingExplanation : AI explanation requested

RetrievingData --> ResultsReady : Explanation not requested

GeneratingExplanation --> ResultsReady : Explanation generated

GeneratingExplanation --> Error : AI service unavailable

RetrievingData --> Error : External API unavailable

ResultsReady --> Idle : New search

Error --> Idle : Retry search

ResultsReady --> [*]
Error --> [*]

@enduml
